    notes="OR-RECHECK: all five quotes of the old row were found verbatim. The 2026-11-13 finding 'four batteries, not five' is withdrawn: it compared the PDF's 'five batteries' with the Twelfth Corps' four and overlooked both Hunt's fifth battery (Rigby) and Hunt's own list of five batteries under Wainwright (p.238). The seed's 'no works described' stays contradicted, now with Hunt p.232, Wainwright p.357, Bachelder 1873 and Maine 1898 besides Whittier.",
